          </zone>
          <zone h='2661' id='40' type-v2='empty' w='98666' x='667' y='9589'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='87083' id='95' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='12250'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>Note:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>1. Dates (day/week/month) in the dashboard represent the &quot;Acquisition Order Date&quot; i.e. date of the first successful order per Acid</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>2. Actual customer value segments have a reporting delay of approximately 1.5 months. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>     Therefore, the most recent segment data is based on </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>predicted segments</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'> and will be updated once actual values become available.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>3. Thailand is excluded from the data</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Metrics Definitions:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Total Acqs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Total distinct acquisition customers (first-time customers)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Acqs with 2nd order in 7D</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers who placed a second successful order within 7 days of their first order.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Acqs with 2nd order in 14D</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers who placed a second  successful order within 14 days of their first order.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Acqs with 2nd order in 30D</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers who placed a second  successful order within 30 days of their first order.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Acqs with Organic first order</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers whose first order was organic (i.e. no discount or voucher or free delivery).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Acqs with 5+ orders in 90D</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers who placed 5 or more  successful orders within 90 days of their first order.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Fraud Acqs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers flagged as fraud by NCI Engine or ML model.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Fraud Acqs %</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Percentage of Fraud Acqs over Total Acqs.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Non-Fraud Acqs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers not flagged as fraud by NCI Engine or ML model.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Non-Fraud Acq with 2nd order in 7D</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Non-fraud acquisition customers with a second successful order within 7 days.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Non-Fraud Acq with 2nd order in 14D</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Non-fraud acquisition customers with a second order within 14 days.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Non-Fraud Acq with 2nd order in 30D</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Non-fraud acquisition customers with a second successful order within 30 days.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>HVC Acqs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers segmented as HVC (High Value Customer).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>HVC Acqs %</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Percentage of HVC Acqs over Total Acqs.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>MVC Acqs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers segmented as MVC (Medium Value Customer).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>MVC Acqs %</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Percentage of MVC Acqs over Total Acqs.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>LVC Acqs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers segmented as LVC (Low Value Customer).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>LVC Acqs %</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Percentage of LVC Acqs over Total Acqs.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>High Loss Acqs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers segmented as High Loss.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>High Loss Acqs %</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Percentage of High Loss Acqs over Total Acqs.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>No Segment Acqs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Acquisition customers with no assigned segment.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>No Segment Acqs %</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Percentage of No Segment Acqs over Total Acqs.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>• </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>Total Reacquisitions</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Total distinct reacquisition customers (customers active after 365+ days)

• Re</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'>acqs with 2nd order in 30D</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='10'> — Reacquisition customers who placed a second  successful order within 30 days of their reacquisition order.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
