            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='670' id='36' type-v2='text' w='13974' x='85411' y='630'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontalignment='2' fontcolor='#b239a4' fontsize='8' italic='true'>#pd-data-marketing    </run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1160' id='113' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='1980'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b239a4' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>Note:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#b239a4' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>1. Users are advised to check the latest data available, as acquisition data may occasionally have a 24–48 hour lag.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>    - Please use the &quot;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>Granularity</run>
              <run fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>&quot; filter set to &quot;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>Daily</run>
              <run fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>&quot; to review the most recent day with complete data. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>2. Actual customer value segments have a reporting delay of approximately 1.5 months. Therefore, the most recent segment data is based on </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>predicted segments</run>
              <run fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'> and will be updated once actual values become available.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
